#. module: documents
#: model_terms:digest.tip,tip_description:documents.digest_tip_documents_0
msgid ""
"An easy way to process incoming mails is to configure your scanner to send "
"PDFs to your folder email. Scanned files will appear automatically in your "
"folder. Then, process your documents in bulk with the split tool: launch "
"user defined actions, request a signature, convert to vendor bills with AI, "
"etc."
msgstr ""
